{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FATHER: Demo</strong> is a free first-person psychological horror demo. It lets you immerse yourself in the atmosphere of the game and experience its core mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033200/extras/242c1e2d17a4bdfb9b2ad4fbeca72aa4.poster.avif?t=1759847765\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033200/extras/242c1e2d17a4bdfb9b2ad4fbeca72aa4.webm?t=1759847765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033200/extras/242c1e2d17a4bdfb9b2ad4fbeca72aa4.mp4?t=1759847765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Caleb \u2014 a father who keeps the household in order, raises his children with strict discipline, and maintains the home according to God\u2019s commandments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033200/extras/e37571206bec7748c0fcf20e612396ae.poster.avif?t=1759847765\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033200/extras/e37571206bec7748c0fcf20e612396ae.webm?t=1759847765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033200/extras/e37571206bec7748c0fcf20e612396ae.mp4?t=1759847765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Isolation and Routine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live by strict rules. Care for the house, keep order, and oversee the behavior of your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033200/extras/4427f5bbdf0fe3e9a05c5c6e5499579b.poster.avif?t=1759847765\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033200/extras/4427f5bbdf0fe3e9a05c5c6e5499579b.webm?t=1759847765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033200/extras/4427f5bbdf0fe3e9a05c5c6e5499579b.mp4?t=1759847765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as familiar things become unsettling. Fear doesn't hide in monsters \u2014 it lingers in silence and glances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033200/extras/78e3d729695e714dac853fc72abeb47a.poster.avif?t=1759847765\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033200/extras/78e3d729695e714dac853fc72abeb47a.webm?t=1759847765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033200/extras/78e3d729695e714dac853fc72abeb47a.mp4?t=1759847765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interactive Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open doors, search rooms, find items and fragments of the story to piece together what truly happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033200/extras/8782a5af4069d415cfe41ab5374780fc.poster.avif?t=1759847765\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033200/extras/8782a5af4069d415cfe41ab5374780fc.webm?t=1759847765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033200/extras/8782a5af4069d415cfe41ab5374780fc.mp4?t=1759847765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Duration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 25\u201330 minutes of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f This demo covers only part of the story and content. The full version of the game will feature more characters, events, and an expanded narrative.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033200?t=1759847765","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033200/7431746d122466609ef1e3d5e76fc2ebf1e77ada/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759847765","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033200/9055136e863274d5b54dc93e782fca000f57587b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759847765","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033200/9055136e863274d5b54dc93e782fca000f57587b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759847765","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Dead bodies, blood and gore"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FATHER: Demo</strong> is a free first-person psychological horror demo. It lets you immerse yourself in the atmosphere of the game and experience its core mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033200/extras/242c1e2d17a4bdfb9b2ad4fbeca72aa4.poster.avif?t=1759847765\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033200/extras/242c1e2d17a4bdfb9b2ad4fbeca72aa4.